widget.

If [mouseCursor] is a [WidgetStateMouseCursor],
[WidgetStateProperty.resolve] is used for the following [WidgetState]s:

 * [WidgetState.dragged].
 * [WidgetState.hovered].
 * [WidgetState.focused].
